---
// Quiz figure for Post 4 set 02: selling 4,000 shares bought at 25,000 for 22,500 (-10% loss).
---
<div class="qfig-sbq04rt">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 580 205" role="img" aria-label="Trade receipt for 4,000 shares bought at 25,000 VND (100M) with 0.15% buy fee and sold at 22,500 VND (90M gross) with 0.15% sell fee and 0.1% sell tax.">
    <text x="16" y="24" class="qfig-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Trade receipt: buy 4,000 shares @ 25,000 → sell @ 22,500</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Sao kê lệnh: mua 4.000 CP @ 25.000 → bán cắt lỗ @ 22.500</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="16" y="44" width="262" height="142" rx="8" class="qfig-card" />
    <text x="32" y="72" class="qfig-t">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Buy leg (Day T)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Chiều Mua (Ngày T)</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="32" y="102">4,000 × 25,000 = 100,000,000</text>
    <text x="32" y="128">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Broker fee (0.15%): 150,000</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Phí CTCK (0,15%): 150.000</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="32" y="158" class="qfig-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Buy tax: 0 VND</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Thuế chiều mua: 0 đồng</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="302" y="44" width="262" height="142" rx="8" class="qfig-card-red" />
    <text x="318" y="72" class="qfig-t qfig-red">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Sell leg (−10% exit)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Chiều Bán (cắt lỗ −10%)</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="318" y="102">4,000 × 22,500 = 90,000,000</text>
    <text x="318" y="128">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Broker fee (0.15%): 135,000</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Phí CTCK (0,15%): 135.000</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="318" y="158" class="qfig-t qfig-red">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Sell PIT tax: 0.1% of 90M = ?</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Thuế bán 0,1% trên 90M = ?</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
</div>

<style>
  .qfig-sbq04rt { margin: 0; width: 100%; }
  .qfig-sbq04rt svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 320px; height: auto; }
  .qfig-sbq04rt text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .qfig-sbq04rt .qfig-h { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-sbq04rt .qfig-t { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-sbq04rt .qfig-m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .qfig-sbq04rt .qfig-red { fill: var(--red); }
  .qfig-sbq04rt .qfig-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .qfig-sbq04rt .qfig-card-red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.4; }
</style>
